WHEREAS, the Sponsored Party is planning to organize and execute an event (hereinafter referred to as the "Event") on or about December 1, 0202, and the Sponsor is willing to provide financial and other support for the Event;

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants and promises herein contained, the parties hereto agree as follows:

1. SPONSORSHIP BENEFITS

2.1 The Sponsor shall provide the Sponsored Party with a total sum of US$500,000 (the "Sponsorship Amount") for the Event.

2.1 The Sponsor shall be entitled to the following benefits in connection with the Event:

2.1.1 The right to display its logo and other promotional materials on all official event website, social media platforms, and other promotional materials;

2.1.2 The right to distribute promotional materials and samples at the Event;

2.2 The right to use the Event’s name and logo in its own marketing and promotional materials;

3. SPONSORED PARTY’S OBLIGATIONS

3.1 The Sponsored Party shall:

3.1.1 Organize and execute the Event in accordance with the agreed-upon plan;

3.1.2 Provide the Sponsor with regular updates on the progress of the Event;

3.1.4 Provide the Sponsor with a detailed report on the outcome of the Event, including attendance, revenue, and other relevant statistics;
